Recognize a two-finger pinch from raw contacts and surface it as PinchEvents (on_pinch), on Android and iOS: GPUI's portable recognizer has none and ignores a second finger. The first finger is cancelled in GPUI when the second lands; fingers left after a pinch, and a third, are ignored until all lift.

